This project distributes MODIFIED builds of Google OR-Tools.

Upstream:  https://github.com/google/or-tools
Commit:    98c165af62df62b3056c2ee0fca66b24e79097cb
License:   Apache License 2.0 (unchanged; see upstream LICENSE)

Apache-2.0 section 4(b) requires modified files to carry prominent notice of
change. The complete set of modifications is third_party/or-tools-fork/timetabling.patch
in this repository. Summary of what was changed:

  ortools/sat/cp_model_utils.{h,cc}  ADDED  ExtractDomainTag() and
                                            GroupVariablesByDomainTag(), which read
                                            structure tags out of variable names.
  ortools/sat/cp_model_lns.{h,cc}    ADDED  DivisionDayNeighborhoodGenerator, an LNS
                                            neighbourhood that relaxes whole
                                            (division, day) blocks.
  ortools/sat/cp_model_solver.cc     ADDED  Registration of the "division_day_lns"
                                            subsolver.
  ortools/sat/cp_model.proto         ADDED  Enum value CHOOSE_MIN_UNFIXED_IN_GROUP = 5.
  ortools/sat/cp_model_search.cc     CHANGED one existing line (a lambda capture) and
                                            added the branching rule for the new enum.

No upstream file is removed and no upstream behaviour changes unless a model opts in
by using the new enum or by naming variables with the tags.

